    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d631">

                <pb facs="0757" n="637" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg637"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Clayton to the Secretary of
                    State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-05-22"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 22, 1905</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2805.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to my No. 2767, of the 15th
                        ultimo,<anchor n="b" xml:id="d631-f1"/> relative to the murder of J. C.
                    Maxwell, J. B. Maxwell, and Enoch Woodworth, I have the honor to transmit
                    herewith a copy and translation of a note from the foreign office, and of its
                    inclosure, the latter being a report <pb facs="0758" n="638" xml:id="pg638"/>
                    from the governor of Sonora showing the proceedings instituted against the
                    persons supposed to be guilty of the crime, one of whom, Muñoz, it appears, was
                    killed by his guards in attempting to escape.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Powell Clayton.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d631-a1.xml" xpointer="d631-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d631-a2.xml" xpointer="d631-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
